        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ios): add OpenClawMascot iconography system with size scale",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe iOS app has no formal mascot/iconography system. The OpenClaw mascot (claw creature) exists only as a small 180px `OpenClawIcon` asset used by a single `OpenClawProMark` component with hardcoded sizes. The style guide defines a full mascot size scale (96pt hero to 20pt inline), status badge composites, and a ghost variant for watermarks — none of which exist in code.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis implements section 03 (Iconography) of the iOS style guide. It adds:\n\n- **High-resolution mascot asset** (512px source → proper 1x/2x/3x asset catalog) as `OpenClawMascot.imageset`\n- **`OpenClawMascotScale` enum** with 6 predefined tiers: `.hero` (96pt), `.emptyState` (64pt), `.sheet` (44pt), `.section` (32pt), `.nav` (24pt), `.inline` (20pt)\n- **`OpenClawMascot` view** that accepts either a scale tier or custom size, with automatic shadow\n- **`OpenClawMascotBadge`** — mascot on a dark rounded surface with a semantic status badge overlay (connected ✓, pending ⧗, error ✗, info ↗, agent ✦, skill ◈, offline —, attention !)\n- **`OpenClawMascotGhost`** — reduced-opacity mascot for empty states and watermarks\n- **Migration** of 3 existing `OpenClawProMark` call sites to the new scale-based API\n\n## User Impact\n\n- Mascot rendering is higher quality (512px source vs 180px)\n- Mascot sizes follow the style guide's predefined scale\n- No visual behavior change at existing call sites (sizes map approximately: 28pt → `.nav` 24pt, 30pt → `.section` 32pt, 64pt → `.emptyState` 64pt)\n- `OpenClawProMark` remains as a legacy wrapper for any external callers\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Build verification\n\n```bash\n# Clean build\nrm -rf ~/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/OpenClaw-*\npnpm ios:gen\ncd apps/ios && xcodebuild -project OpenClaw.xcodeproj -scheme OpenClaw \\\n  -destination \"platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro\" build\n# BUILD SUCCEEDED\n```\n\n### Asset verification\n\n```\nOpenClawMascot.imageset/\n├── Contents.json          (1x/2x/3x with original rendering intent)\n├── openclaw-mascot@1x.png (171×171)\n├── openclaw-mascot@2x.png (341×341)\n└── openclaw-mascot@3x.png (512×512)\n```\n\nSource: `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/png/openclaw-dark.png`\n\n### Components added\n\n| Component | Purpose | File |\n|---|---|---|\n| `OpenClawMascotScale` | Size scale enum (hero/emptyState/sheet/section/nav/inline) | `OpenClawMascot.swift` |\n| `OpenClawMascot` | Core mascot view with scale + shadow | `OpenClawMascot.swift` |\n| `OpenClawMascotBadge` | Mascot + semantic status badge overlay | `OpenClawMascot.swift` |\n| `OpenClawMascotBadgeTone` | 8 status tones (connected/pending/error/info/agent/skill/offline/attention) | `OpenClawMascot.swift` |\n| `OpenClawMascotGhost` | Reduced-opacity watermark variant | `OpenClawMascot.swift` |\n\n### Call sites migrated\n\n| Location | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| `CommandCenterTab.swift` | `OpenClawProMark(size: 28)` | `OpenClawMascot(scale: .nav)` |\n| `RootTabs.swift` | `OpenClawProMark(size: 30)` | `OpenClawMascot(scale: .section)` |\n| `OnboardingWizardSteps.swift` | `OpenClawProMark(size: 64)` | `OpenClawMascot(scale: .emptyState)` |\n\n— [Joel Nishanth](https://offlyn.ai) · [offlyn.AI](https://offlyn.ai)\n",
        "branch": "feat/ios-iconography",
